{
  "name": "zen-launcher",
  "productName": "ZEN Launcher",
  "version": "2.3.8",
  "releaseDate": "2026-11-09",
  "description": "![](./doc/thumbnail-01.png)",
  "main": "main.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "test": "node --test zenDialog.test.js src/main/domain/program/programVisibility.test.js src/main/domain/launcher/launcherFrame.test.js src/main/domain/launcher/recommendedFolders.test.js src/main/domain/launcher/recommendedGalleries.test.js src/main/domain/launcher/launcherSlots.test.js src/main/domain/launcher/executableCommand.test.js src/main/infrastructure/tray/appTray.test.js src/main/infrastructure/windows/foregroundFullscreen.test.js src/main/infrastructure/windows/masterMute.test.js",
    "build:win32": "electron-builder --win nsis --ia32 --publish never",
    "build:win64": "electron-builder --win nsis --x64 --publish never",
    "build:win": "electron-builder --win nsis --ia32 --x64 --publish never",
    "release:win": "electron-builder --win nsis --ia32 --x64 --publish always"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/JISU-YANG/NP-Launcher.git"
  },
  "author": "Noly-Poly",
  "license": "ISC",
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "^29.1.4",
    "electron-builder": "^24.13.3",
    "electron-devtools-installer": "^3.2.0"
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.jisuyang.zenlauncher",
    "artifactName": "${name}-${version}-setup-${arch}.${ext}",
    "files": [
      "**/*",
      "!dist/**",
      "!doc/**",
      "!**/*.md"
    ],
    "publish": {
      "provider": "github",
      "owner": "JISU-YANG",
      "repo": "ZEN-Launcher",
      "releaseType": "release"
    },
    "releaseInfo": {
      "releaseName": "v2.3.8",
      "releaseNotes": "아이콘을 편집할 때 추천에서 계산기, 시계, 메모장, 캡처도구, 그림판, 화상 키보드를 고를 수 있습니다.\n\n폴더 추천에는 바탕화면, 다운로드, 스크린샷, 휴지통, 카카오톡 받은 파일이 있습니다.\n\n갤러리 추천에는 MapleStory, Sudden Attack, League of Legends, VALORANT, BATTLEGROUNDS, Mabinogi가 있습니다. MapleStory, Sudden Attack, Mabinogi는 넥슨 플러그로, League of Legends와 VALORANT는 Riot Client로, BATTLEGROUNDS는 Steam으로 실행합니다. 포스터는 앱에 들어 있습니다.\n\n갤러리 여섯 번째 칸도 추가할 수 있습니다."
    },
    "win": {
      "icon": "src/app/ZEN-Launcher.png",
      "signAndEditExecutable": true,
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "nsis",
          "arch": [
            "x64",
            "ia32"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "perMachine": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "allowElevation": true,
      "createDesktopShortcut": true,
      "createStartMenuShortcut": true,
      "shortcutName": "ZEN Launcher",
      "uninstallDisplayName": "ZEN Launcher",
      "deleteAppDataOnUninstall": false,
      "runAfterFinish": true
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "electron-shutdown-command": "^2.0.1",
    "electron-store": "^8.2.0",
    "electron-updater": "^6.8.11"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/JISU-YANG/NP-Launcher/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/JISU-YANG/NP-Launcher#readme"
}
